# API-007 — headers on a live seller (npm run target:agenttrust)

$ curl -sI http://127.0.0.1:4022/health
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Cache-Control: no-store
Vary: PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, Accept-Encoding

$ curl -si -X POST .../v1/summarise  (no payment -> 402 quote)
HTTP/1.1 402 Payment Required
Cache-Control: no-store
Vary: PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, Accept-Encoding

$ curl -si http://127.0.0.1:4022/no-such-route  (404)
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
Cache-Control: no-store
Vary: PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, Accept-Encoding
{"error":{"code":"not_found","message":"no such route"}}